      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "S01",
          "narration_id": "N01",
          "text": "这场逃亡跨越七十八天，五条生命在途中消逝。",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.41,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.09,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.98,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.8,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0418,
          "speech_start": 0.03,
          "speech_end": 4.83,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S02",
          "narration_id": "N01",
          "text": "最终识破他的，竟是一名小学五年级的女孩。",
          "start": 5.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.435,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.09,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.98,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.98,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 5.03,
          "speech_end": 9.01,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
        },
        {
          "id": "S03",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "一九六三年十月十八日，福冈县接连传来噩耗，两名男子先后遇害。",
          "start": 10.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.827,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.49,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.38,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.38,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 10.03,
          "speech_end": 16.41,
          "characters": 27,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.857
        },
        {
          "id": "S04",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "警方反复核查目击者提供的线索，终于锁定一名有前科的嫌疑人。",
          "start": 17.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.503,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.32,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.21,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.21,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 17.03,
          "speech_end": 22.24,
          "characters": 27,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.857
        },
        {
          "id": "S05",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "他叫西口彰，当时三十七岁，曾因诈骗和盗窃获罪。",
          "start": 24.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.921,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.58,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.47,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.47,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 24.03,
          "speech_end": 29.5,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S06",
          "narration_id": "N02",
          "text": "福冈警方随即发出全国通缉，寻找他的踪迹。",
          "start": 30.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.725,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.39,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.28,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.28,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 30.03,
          "speech_end": 34.31,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
        },
        {
          "id": "S07",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "逃亡途中，他从报纸得知，自己的脸已出现在全国通缉令上。",
          "start": 35.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.095,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.88,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.77,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.77,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 35.03,
          "speech_end": 40.8,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S08",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "在濑户内海渡轮的甲板上，他留下鞋子和书信，布置了一场假死。",
          "start": 42.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.5,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.22,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.11,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.11,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 42.03,
          "speech_end": 48.14,
          "characters": 26,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.714
        },
        {
          "id": "S09",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "这场假死只是障眼法，他已经换了身份继续逃亡。",
          "start": 49.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.027,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.8,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.69,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.69,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 49.03,
          "speech_end": 53.72,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S10",
          "narration_id": "N03",
          "text": "搜寻没有结果，警方判断，所谓自杀只是伪装。",
          "start": 55.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.329,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.96,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.85,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.79,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0152,
          "speech_start": 55.03,
          "speech_end": 59.82,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
        },
        {
          "id": "S11",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "他辗转各地，时而自称教授，用体面外表赢得信任。",
          "start": 60.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.712,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.39,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.28,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.28,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 60.03,
          "speech_end": 65.31,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.857
        },
        {
          "id": "S12",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "之后他又冒充律师，凭着体面的谈吐与外表，继续在各地行骗。",
          "start": 67.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.329,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.11,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.0,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.0,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 67.03,
          "speech_end": 72.03,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.571
        },
        {
          "id": "S13",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "从神户到京都、名古屋，他不断更换衣着和说辞。",
          "start": 74.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.027,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.68,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.57,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.57,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 74.03,
          "speech_end": 78.6,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S14",
          "narration_id": "N04",
          "text": "据公开资料，他诈骗所得合计约八十万日元。",
          "start": 80.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.201,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.94,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.83,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0111,
          "speech_start": 80.03,
          "speech_end": 84.81,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
        },
        {
          "id": "S15",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "十一月，静冈滨松一家旅馆的经营者母女遇害。",
          "start": 85.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.725,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.31,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.2,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.2,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 85.03,
          "speech_end": 89.23,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S16",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "两条生命消逝，旅馆里只剩下寂静。",
          "start": 91.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.435,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.15,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.04,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.04,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 91.03,
          "speech_end": 95.07,
          "characters": 14,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S17",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "到了十二月末，东京的一位律师也成了受害者，案件仍在扩大。",
          "start": 97.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.304,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.96,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.85,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0135,
          "speech_start": 97.03,
          "speech_end": 102.81,
          "characters": 25,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S18",
          "narration_id": "N05",
          "text": "福冈、滨松、东京，前前后后，已经有五人失去了生命。",
          "start": 103.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.095,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.81,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.7,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.79,
          "tempo_factor": 1.1892,
          "speech_start": 103.03,
          "speech_end": 107.82,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S19",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "一九六四年一月二日，新年刚过，他来到熊本县的玉名市。",
          "start": 108.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.827,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.46,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.35,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.1022,
          "speech_start": 108.03,
          "speech_end": 113.81,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S20",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "他冒充川村律师，拜访教诲师古川泰龙。",
          "start": 114.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.899,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.71,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.6,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.6,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 114.03,
          "speech_end": 118.63,
          "characters": 16,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S21",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "他声称愿意帮助古川，为冤案奔走的活动。",
          "start": 120.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.831,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.48,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.37,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.37,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 120.03,
          "speech_end": 123.4,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S22",
          "narration_id": "N06",
          "text": "一家人热情接待，女儿却觉得这张脸十分眼熟。",
          "start": 125.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.214,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.9,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.79,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.79,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 125.03,
          "speech_end": 128.82,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S23",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "女孩想起曾经见过的通缉照片，越看越觉得，眼前的客人与照片上的人很像。",
          "start": 130.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.721,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 7.4,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 7.29,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.77,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0778,
          "speech_start": 130.03,
          "speech_end": 136.8,
          "characters": 31,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S24",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "她将疑虑告诉家人，父亲起初并不相信，家人随后又核对了照片。",
          "start": 137.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.304,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.93,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.82,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.82,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 137.03,
          "speech_end": 142.85,
          "characters": 26,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.714
        },
        {
          "id": "S25",
          "narration_id": "N07",
          "text": "家人再三核对，古川最终决定悄悄向警方求助。",
          "start": 144.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.818,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.6,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.49,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.49,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 144.03,
          "speech_end": 148.52,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S26",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "警方核实身份，发现这名来客并非真正的律师。",
          "start": 150.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.598,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.33,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.22,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.22,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 150.03,
          "speech_end": 154.25,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S27",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "夜色中，警员赶到寺院附近，静静等待天亮。",
          "start": 156.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.725,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.33,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.22,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.22,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 156.03,
          "speech_end": 160.25,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S28",
          "narration_id": "N08",
          "text": "一月三日，警方确认身份，西口彰被捕，逃亡就此结束。",
          "start": 162.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.014,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.65,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.54,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.54,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 162.03,
          "speech_end": 167.57,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
        },
        {
          "id": "S29",
          "narration_id": "N09",
          "text": "从十月十八日算起，七十八天的逃亡画上句号。",
          "start": 168.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.899,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.62,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.51,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.51,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 168.03,
          "speech_end": 172.54,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S30",
          "narration_id": "N09",
          "text": "他后来被判处死刑，一九七零年执行。",
          "start": 174.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.1,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.73,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.62,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.62,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 174.03,
          "speech_end": 177.65,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.5
        }
      ],
